#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:13
msgid "## Background of OSPO Establishment"
msgstr "## OSPO 成立的背景"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:14
msgid ""
"The OSPO at [Company Name] was established in **[Month, Year]** as part of [Establishment Background (e.g., Digital Transformation Strategy)].\n"
"Rapidly expanding OSS usage created challenges around [OSS Challenges Faced (e.g., license compliance, security vulnerabilities)], while leadership sought [Target OSS Outcomes (e.g., enhancing engineering prestige and technical brand through open source contributions)]."
msgstr ""
"[公司名稱] 的 OSPO 於 **[成立年月]** 成立，是 [成立背景（例如：數位轉型策略）] 的一環。\n"
"隨著開放原始碼使用量急速成長，必須應對 [自家公司面臨的 OSS 相關課題（例如：授權遵循與資訊安全課題）]，同時也希望達成 [期望透過 OSS 運用達成的效果（例如：透過貢獻開放原始碼提升品牌並強化技術能力）]，這些成為成立的契機。"

#. type: 標題
