#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:16
msgid "1. **[Title of Priority 1 (e.g., Formulating and Rollout of Open Source Policy)]**"
msgstr "1. **[重點活動 1 的標題（例如：制定並宣導開放原始碼使用政策）]**"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:17
msgid ""
