"   - [Action 2 (e.g., Host regular training and workshops to ensure awareness and comprehension)]"
msgstr ""
"   - [措施 1（例如：制定全公司通用的 OSS 使用指南，並在公司內部入口網站公開）]\n"
"   - [措施 2（例如：定期舉辦訓練與讀書會，促進員工理解並徹底宣導）]"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:18
msgid "2. **[Title of Priority 2 (e.g., Strengthening License Compliance Framework)]**"
msgstr "2. **[重點活動 2 的標題（例如：強化授權合規體制）]**"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:19
msgid ""
"   - [Action 1 (e.g., Evaluate major OSS licenses and clarify review criteria for complex terms)]\n"
"   - [Action 2 (e.g., Standardize OSS approval requests and establish Legal consultation workflows)]"
msgstr ""
"   - [措施 1（例如：評估主要 OSS 的授權條款，明確需要注意的條件與判斷觀點）]\n"
"   - [措施 2（例如：標準化 OSS 使用申請流程，並與法務部門協作建立可提供建議的體制）]"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:20
msgid "3. **[Title of Priority 3 (e.g., Building Collaboration with Security Teams)]**"
msgstr "3. **[重點活動 3 的標題（例如：建置與資訊安全部門的協作體制）]**"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/about/ospo.md:21
msgid ""
"   - [Action 1 (e.g., Collaborate with Security to deploy OSS vulnerability scanning tools and periodic audits)]\n"
"   - [Action 2 (e.g., Define joint incident response workflows for OSS security vulnerabilities)]"
msgstr ""
"   - [措施 1（例如：與資訊安全部門合作，支援導入 OSS 弱點掃描工具並定期執行安全檢查）]\n"
"   - [措施 2（例如：與資訊安全部門協作，建置資訊安全事件發生時的應對流程）]"

